    "body": "P3 · effort:medium · area:ui — triage.\n\nP3: wrong behaviour a user hits, with a workaround. The refusal is correct and the stock does not change. The page shows a control that cannot work in the selected mode.\neffort:medium: one UI page. The show/hide pattern exists. The fix clears the stale refusal and hides, or disables, the fit controls for from-model stock. The safety floor does not apply: no posted G-code and no collision check change.\n",
