    "body": "The fix is committed locally as 015cafbe on issue/1683-stock-fit-mode.\nIt lives in .claude/worktrees/issue-1683.\nThe two structural pins failed before the fix and pass after it.\nRestoring the old page and removing each guard made the pins fail again.\nThe quick gate passed 800 tests with 5 ignored.\nUI clippy passed with warnings denied.\nNo goldens changed.\n\nAutomatic approval review rejected git push -u origin issue/1683-stock-fit-mode.\nThe command requires approval, but this session has approval policy Never.\nNo branch was pushed and no PR was opened.\nI preserved the worktree and commit for handoff.\nClaim released because this worker cannot push.\n",
